        "correctAnswer": "Find two numbers whose product is c and whose sum is b.",
        "explanation": "Those numbers give the factors, for example x^2 + 5x + 6 = (x + 2)(x + 3).",
        "difficulty": "easy"
      },
      {
        "questionText": "What is factorization by grouping?",
        "options": [],
        "correctAnswer": "Grouping terms in pairs, factoring each pair, then taking out a common bracket.",
